OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FOn the week's second visit, the
OL,7,     FB&Bers go barmy for the converted
OL,8,     Fbarns at The Shuckburgh Arms in
OL,9,     FNorthamptonshire. But one guest
OL,10,     Fisn't buzzing about a broken
OL,11,     Ffridge.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FOn day three, the hosts take some
OL,14,     Fflack for the lack of a welcome
OL,15,     Fpack at Beachside Holidays in
OL,16,     FGreat Yarmouth. At least the sea
OL,17,     Fviews are stunning.
